      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href="https://github.com/middlewarr/middlewarr">GitHub</a><a
        href="https://docs.middlewarr.dev/">Documentation</a
      ><a href="#top">Back to Top <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a>
